{"content":[{"c":["EHUD"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Judge of Israel from Benjamin’s tribe who delivered Israel from Eglon, king of the Moabites (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.3.12-30","r":"Judg.3.12-30","rawR":"Judg.3.12-30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.3.12-30","value":"Judg.3.12-30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 3:12-30"},"). He was notable because he was left-handed (Hebrew “hindered in the right hand”). Before taking Israelite tribute to Eglon, he made an iron dagger, with which he assassinated the unsuspecting Eglon during a private audience. He then rallied the Israelites west of the Jordan to encircle the Moabite troops before they could return south to Moab. When the 18-year rule of Eglon over the Israelites ended, an 80-year period of peace began."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Bilhan’s son, a member of Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.10","r":"1Chr.7.10","rawR":"1Chr.7.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.10","value":"1Chr.7.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.6","r":"1Chr.8.6","rawR":"1Chr.8.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.6","value":"1Chr.8.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"8:6"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Ehud","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jgs 3:12-30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.3.12-30","rawQueryValue":"Judg.3.12-30","sourceRefExact":"Judg.3.12-30"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 7:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.7.10","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.7.10","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.7.10"},{"anchorText":"8:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.6","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.6","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.6"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"03cf332ec62bca8e09e6737670810cb28973efd4b7a3fb1574e65d3afe23aa5e","sourceItemName":"Ehud","sourceItemOrder":47,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ehud","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Ehud","title":"Ehud","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}